VGGT-Ω-SLAM — license scope
==========================

This repository contains original integration code and identified adaptations
of third-party code. It is not offered under a single license covering the
entire software/model/data stack.

The BSD 2-Clause license below applies only to the original contributions of
VGGT-Ω-SLAM, excluding third-party code, adaptations identified in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, model checkpoints, datasets, and model outputs/results.
The original third-party licenses continue to apply to their respective
material. In particular:

* The copied VGGT_SPARK attention-similarity functions retain CC-BY-NC-4.0.
* The evo-derived evaluation helpers identified in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
  retain GPL-3.0-or-later.
* VGGT-Omega research materials are governed by the FAIR Noncommercial Research
  License and its Acceptable Use Policy. That agreement also restricts use of
  outputs/results; this repository does not remove those restrictions.
* VGGT-SLAM code retains BSD 2-Clause, SALAD retains GPLv3, and DINOv2 retains
  Apache-2.0, with separately licensed third-party components where indicated.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licenses/ for provenance, scope, and unmodified
license texts. This BSD grant does not relicense any of the above material or
grant additional rights to checkpoints, datasets, outputs, or a combined
distribution. Checkpoints and datasets are obtained separately from their
respective providers.

